{
  "schema": "2.0",
  "header": {
    "title": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "富文本语法使用示例：音频播放器 <audio>"
    },
    "template": "blue"
  },
  "body": {
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**1. 默认效果**\n<audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\"></audio>"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**2. 显示时间 (show_time)**\n<audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\" show_time=\"true\"></audio>"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**3. 自定义颜色 (HEX)**\n<audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\" config.style.color=\"#FF6A00\"></audio>"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**4. 枚举色 (red / green / blue / grey)**\n<audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\" config.style.color=\"red\"></audio>\n<audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\" config.style.color=\"green\"></audio>\n<audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\" config.style.color=\"blue\"></audio>\n<audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\" config.style.color=\"grey\"></audio>"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**5. 语音样式 (style=speak)**\n<audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\" style=\"speak\"></audio>"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**6. Fallback 兜底文案**\n<audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\">当前环境不支持音频播放，请升级飞书版本</audio>"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**7. 不同 text_size 下的播放器**\n<text_size size=\"normal\"><audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\" show_time=\"true\"></audio></text_size>\n<text_size size=\"small\"><audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\" show_time=\"true\"></audio></text_size>\n<text_size size=\"notation\"><audio src=\"https://example.com/demo.mp3\" show_time=\"true\"></audio></text_size>"
      }
    ]
  }
}
